{
  "_comment": "H16: one cloud VM per walk group (GATEWAY-WALK-PLAN-706). launch.sh <group> reads this. job: gate (typecheck, catalog, offline harness), walks (bin/e2e build + one up per profile + playwright.walk.config.ts), hosted (W19, e2e/walks/hosted/run-hosted.sh). grep selects the walks by their @walk-Wnn tags; strict names the walks that need the egress kit (e2e/walks/kit/strict-kit.sh) for acceptance. productSha is the product commit the run stands for (shipped with --ref; the receipt checks HEAD's product is identical to it). lane is the cloud lane (one VM each); gate and dryrun-int2 share gw-walk-int2, so the cheap gate and the dry run reuse one STANDARD VM and its Docker images.",
